                <head>No. 22.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.–<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1865-02-17">February 17, 1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">M. le Charge d’Affairs des Etats Unis à Paris:</hi></p>
                <p>Limited repairs on Stonewall are finished; reported, notwithstanding, in very bad
                    condition; cannot go to sea; leaks badly; her commander starts for Paris; her
                    builder is expected from Bordeaux; consul says will have to be abandoned.
                    Niagara at Ferrol; Sacramento not arrived; letter by mail.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
